  "dcterms:title": "OECD eChemPortal \u2014 Global Portal to Information on Chemical Substances (substance search results)",
  "dcterms:description": "Substance-level search results harvested from OECD eChemPortal (www.echemportal.org), the Global Portal to Information on Chemical Substances. The crawler (src/biobricks/echemportal.clj) drives the eChemPortal substance-search UI with CAS-number wildcards and exports the CSV result tables. eChemPortal is an aggregation/search layer over ~35 external regulatory databases (ECHA REACH, EPA CompTox, Health Canada CCR, OECD SIDS, J-CHECK, etc.), each of which owns its own data under its own terms.",
